  "job_B23.3.3.1_20251003_114605": {
    "text": "On anre nihte ealdne monan, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee m\u00e6te\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t cym\u00f0 to gefean.\nOn tweigra nihta monan & on \u00fereora, n\u00e6f\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t swefen n\u00e6nige fremednesse godes ne yfeles.\nOn feowernihtne & on fifa, \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00fe god swefen, wite \u00feu, \u00fe\u00e6t georne on \u00feinre heortan.\nOn syx nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t\u00fee \u00feonne \u00feince, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu geseo, \u00fe\u00e6t beo f\u00e6st on \u00feinum breostum, wite, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein ge\u00feanc\nOn vii nihta, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee on eage byre\u00fe, \u00e6fter tide cym\u00f0 seo endung.\nOn viii nihte & on ix, sona \u00fe\u00e6t ype\u00f0, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee geswefna\u00fe, gif \u00feu unrotnesse gesawe, wend \u00fein\nOn x nihta \u00fein swefen ag\u00e6\u00fe butan frecnesse.\nOn xi nihta \u00fe\u00e6t swefen ag\u00e6\u00fe mid gefean.\nOn xii & on xiii nihta binnan \u00ferim nihton \u00feu gesyhst, \u00fe\u00e6t\u00fee \u00e6r on swefne \u00e6tywede.\nOn xiiii nihta, n\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6nige fremednesse godes ne yfeles.\nOn xv nihta, sceortwyrplic \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00fe.\nOn xvi nihta \u00e6fter langre tide hit ag\u00e6\u00f0.\nOn xvii & on xviii & on xix nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t swefen by\u00fe go & on manegum dagum geenda\u00f0.\nOn xx nihta & on xxi \u00fe\u00e6t tacna\u00fe ceapunga & hwearfunga.\nOn xxii & on xxiii nihta, seo m\u00e6ting by\u00fe gecornes & geflites & eall costnunge full, ne bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t na god\nOn xxiiii nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t tacna\u00fe.\nToweardlice firhto & brogan & on nigon dagum o\u00f0\u00f0e on x \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00fe geypped, ac wend \u00fein heafod east,\nOn xxvii & on xxviii nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t swefen tacna\u00fe ealne gefean, & ealle angsumnesse & unea\u00f0nesse\nOn xxix nihta, eall swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6rre.\nOn xxx nihta, \u00e6r tweigra nihta fyrste \u00fe\u00e6t swefen ag\u00e6\u00f0 butan frecnum \u00feingum.",
